From fbd4dd05b2c9ebae473a23de73c9ba8a6c5b570a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 01:11:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(admin-tools): Risk Breaches, Battle Inspector, Price
 Movement Audit and Risk Terminal on the settlement record

Risk Breaches rewritten: period presets and scope, server summary for the whole
period, shortfall / house cash columns, resolution from the list, Details calls
the server audit (settlement breakdown, per-user cash PnL, NPC payouts).
Battle Inspector: LIVE badge only on ACTIVE rows, period presets with exact local
day boundaries, MODEL / COMMISSION / HOUSE CASH columns, settlement panel,
participants per side with hedged / house markers; history modal gets All time.
Price Movement Audit: All Time, numeric threshold, swing-fallback marker, freeze
seconds and config source, replay method under the chart, status-aware CSV and
post-save refetch.
Risk Terminal: settlement model and leader, House Cash Result / Commission /
Shortfall per scenario, breach badges replace Thin Margin, integrity alerts table,
refetch on round change.
Slice: exact-instant ranges (start_at/end_at), scope, risk breach detail and
terminal alerts thunks; deep history without period on a battle id.
Build: workbox precache limit raised for the main bundle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dzk243ADEkJuWxdHGG3hNv
